{"id": "en_tsunami_p1", "total": 75.39, "segments": [{"text": "If you hear a tsunami siren on a dark beach, do not try to run away in your car.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.86}, {"text": "Japan 2011 surveys show about a third of evacuees got stuck in traffic jams fast.", "start": 4.38, "end": 9.18}, {"text": "Mark stands on the sand at night when the sea suddenly pulls back far from the shore.", "start": 10.02, "end": 13.54}, {"text": "One. He sees the water vanish and knows a dangerous wave is coming right now.", "start": 14.28, "end": 18.22}, {"text": "Mark ignores his car and starts to walk to shelter on foot across the dark beach.", "start": 18.86, "end": 22.24}, {"text": "He walks fast past terrified people who panic in the coastal town tonight.", "start": 22.6, "end": 25.86}, {"text": "Two. He finds a strong reinforced concrete hotel that stands 10 floors high.", "start": 26.42, "end": 30.86}, {"text": "Mark enters the building and moves past the lobby without wasting any precious seconds.", "start": 31.42, "end": 34.74}, {"text": "Three. He runs up the stairs because he cannot go far from the shore safely.", "start": 35.18, "end": 38.62}, {"text": "He climbs higher and higher until he reaches the top of the safe structure.", "start": 39.16, "end": 42.22}, {"text": "He goes above the 4th floor to escape the coming dark water below.", "start": 42.76, "end": 45.82}, {"text": "Mark finishes his climb and reaches the roof before the ocean strikes the land.", "start": 46.5, "end": 49.9}, {"text": "Dark ocean water rushes violently across the beach and floods the empty streets completely.", "start": 50.5, "end": 54.8}, {"text": "The wave smashes into the lower levels of the concrete hotel with massive force.", "start": 55.36, "end": 58.8}, {"text": "Mark is safe from the water because he followed every single official safety rule.", "start": 59.58, "end": 63.42}, {"text": "It was the perfect plan for surviving the disaster.", "start": 64.0, "end": 65.76}, {"text": "There was just one problem.", "start": 66.62, "end": 67.64}, {"text": "The first wave is often not the biggest, and the freezing night air is turning into snow.", "start": 68.4, "end": 72.24}], "words": [["If", 0.0, 0.28], ["you", 0.28, 0.38], ["hear", 0.38, 0.6], ["a", 0.6, 0.74], ["tsunami", 0.74, 1.0], ["siren", 1.0, 1.38], ["on", 1.38, 1.52], ["a", 1.52, 1.62], ["dark", 1.62, 1.82], ["beach,", 1.82, 2.18], ["do", 2.36, 2.42], ["not", 2.42, 2.74], ["try", 2.74, 3.02], ["to", 3.02, 3.12], ["run", 3.12, 3.24], ["away", 3.24, 3.44], ["in", 3.44, 3.56], ["your", 3.56, 3.66], ["car.", 3.66, 3.86], ["Japan", 4.38, 4.62], ["2011", 4.607, 4.871], ["surveys", 5.52, 5.72], ["show", 5.72, 6.04], ["about", 6.04, 6.28], ["a", 6.28, 6.44], ["third", 6.44, 6.74], ["of", 6.74, 6.96], ["evacuees", 6.96, 7.48], ["got", 7.48, 7.6], ["stuck", 7.6, 7.88], ["in", 7.88, 8.1], ["traffic", 8.1, 8.44], ["jams", 8.44, 8.74], ["fast.", 8.74, 9.18], ["Mark", 10.02, 10.12], ["stands", 10.12, 10.4], ["on", 10.4, 10.56], ["the", 10.56, 10.66], ["sand", 10.66, 10.84], ["at", 10.84, 10.96], ["night", 10.96, 11.16], ["when", 11.16, 11.36], ["the", 11.36, 11.44], ["sea", 11.44, 11.6], ["suddenly", 11.6, 12.02], ["pulls", 12.02, 12.36], ["back", 12.36, 12.64], ["far", 12.64, 13.06], ["from", 13.06, 13.26], ["the", 13.26, 13.36], ["shore.", 13.36, 13.54], ["One.", 14.28, 14.46], ["He", 14.82, 15.1], ["sees", 15.1, 15.26], ["the", 15.26, 15.42], ["water", 15.42, 15.6], ["vanish", 15.6, 15.96], ["and", 15.96, 16.26], ["knows", 16.26, 16.5], ["a", 16.5, 16.74], ["dangerous", 16.74, 17.02], ["wave", 17.02, 17.28], ["is", 17.28, 17.44], ["coming", 17.44, 17.66], ["right", 17.66, 17.98], ["now.", 17.98, 18.22], ["Mark", 18.86, 18.98], ["ignores", 18.98, 19.32], ["his", 19.32, 19.5], ["car", 19.5, 19.66], ["and", 19.66, 19.86], ["starts", 19.86, 20.1], ["to", 20.1, 20.3], ["walk", 20.3, 20.44], ["to", 20.44, 20.62], ["shelter", 20.62, 20.78], ["on", 20.78, 21.04], ["foot", 21.04, 21.3], ["across", 21.3, 21.66],